{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787097948373366348,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cookable-governing-cockatoo","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e27bc567d8cc915a287a07b84d4ca374d461458b61b20a0ffdbe1e719c1fef94","event_uuid":"a511b170-77e3-4420-b229-60af3708bd89","position":{"commit_sha":"b8ac864a0d924d5ad57374f0c7aed418b5b28cb1","position":"1787095121445216001-a511b170-77e3-4420-b229-60af3708bd89"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6970d72e0cfa65b06388b34601f10d819e8a7e0f15abce2e48d5ca81cc87e8ed","event_uuid":"95a10299-a64b-4552-8c55-2d77b147b44e","position":{"commit_sha":"5125542f100aed2e53ba5753cdd18ebe597910a3","position":"1787095170148519001-95a10299-a64b-4552-8c55-2d77b147b44e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"350d2b340bbf12b28ed4af9c10683fa0ccaa15140aef0879ee633e0a5d63f4ab","event_uuid":"4bb7d9e0-c037-46cc-84a0-db9f86f9dc12","position":{"commit_sha":"e0fcfac81745215e5b6ea6569c9c53a7e966b790","position":"1787095256368980001-4bb7d9e0-c037-46cc-84a0-db9f86f9dc12"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787095121445216001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nSlice C1 (ticket 29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8) recorded 27 below-seam ambient config/credential reads in the llm / workflow / grounding subsystem (llm/, grounding/, llm/workflow) as entries in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS`. RP-04 is not complete while these ambient reads sit below the approved composition/credential/backend seams enforced by `scripts/check_config_ownership.py`. Parent: 075b-1479-dcb7-40ab.\n\nAffected files (relative to `src/rebar/`):\n  - `src/rebar/grounding/harness.py`\n  - `src/rebar/grounding/oracle.py`\n  - `src/rebar/grounding/resolve.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/completion.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_floor.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/drift_floor.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/pin_health.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sizing.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/workflow_ops.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/xcheck.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_banking.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/criterion_preview.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_ops.py`\n  - `src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py`\n\n## Outcome\nEvery below-seam read in the files above is either (a) CUT to compose through the approved seam that already assembles config — the operation snapshot (`rebar._operation_config.OperationSnapshot` / `compose_operation_snapshot`), a startup binding, or the provider-credential boundary — or (b) REGISTERED as an owned, non-legacy entry with an exact `path`+`symbol`+`rationale` for genuine test-only controls and protocol constants. Their `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries are removed. `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` reports zero findings for these paths with those entries gone and no path-glob exception. The subsystem's behavioral suites stay green; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded, justified deltas.\n\n## Plan\n1. For each below-seam read in the listed files, classify as cut-to-seam or register-owned; for cut-to-seam, thread the value from the composition seam rather than reading ambient `os.environ`/`os.getenv`/`load_config` below it.\n2. Remove the corresponding entries for these files from `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`.\n3. Run `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` and the subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit/plan_review, tests/interfaces/store/test_llm_framework.py, grounding suites); keep green.\n\n## Testing (RED -> GREEN)\n- Held-out test `tests/scripts/test_llm_workflow_seam_clean_heldout.py` asserts `check_config_ownership.check(check_config_ownership.REPO_ROOT)` returns no finding string containing any of the listed paths, AND that `config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` contains zero entries whose `path` is one of the listed files. RED now (entries present + reads below seam).\n- The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit/plan_review, tests/interfaces/store/test_llm_framework.py, grounding suites) stay green after the cutover — they are the correctness oracle the AST gate supplements.\n- Redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints before/after are equal except recorded deltas.\n\n## Compatibility / rollback\nNo stored ticket/event/binding format changes. A legacy facade is removed only after its focused suite passes; until then rollback selects the facade.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No direct ambient config/credential read, backend reload, or configurable default remains below the approved seam in the 22 listed files; each is cut-to-seam or registered as an owned (non-legacy) entry with rationale.\n- [ ] The `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries for these files are removed from `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`, and `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` passes with no path-glob exception (proven by the held-out `test_llm_workflow_seam_clean_heldout.py`).\n- [ ] The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit/plan_review, tests/interfaces/store/test_llm_framework.py, grounding suites) pass after the cutover; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded approved deltas.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/grounding/harness.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/grounding/oracle.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/grounding/resolve.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/completion.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_floor.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/drift_floor.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/pin_health.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sizing.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/workflow_ops.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/xcheck.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_banking.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/criterion_preview.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_ops.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py","reason":"Remove C3d LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS entries as reads are cut to seam."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_llm_workflow_seam_clean_heldout.py","reason":"Held-out proof: gate clean + zero legacy entries for these files."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","075b-1479-dcb7-40ab"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"075b-1479-dcb7-40ab","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts"